; ASCII only (rc.exe reads this as ANSI).
; 1 ICON = the exe's own icon (title bar / taskbar / Alt-Tab). Same app.ico as
; the main exe, referenced by MAKEINTRESOURCEW(1) in info.c. Path is relative
; to this .rc file's directory (info/), so ../res/app.ico = res/app.ico.
1 ICON "../res/app.ico"

; 1 24 = CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID + RT_MANIFEST. Embeds the comctl32
; v6 dependency (themed, modern scrollbars) and Win10/11 compatibility. Without
; a v6 manifest the process falls back to comctl32 v5 and draws classic
; Win95-style gray scrollbars -- the "retro" look this resource removes.
1 24 "info.manifest"